ew candidate only; deployment status unknown."]},{"applicability_suggestion":"unknown","case_impacts":[],"document_citations":[{"end_char":102,"quote":"## 订单导出\r\n","source_id":"parse:51a9af8f-492e-43cf-a793-688fdb61bc32","start_char":93,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"},{"end_char":139,"quote":"新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\r\n","source_id":"parse:51a9af8f-492e-43cf-a793-688fdb61bc32","start_char":102,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"}],"key":"order-export-added","kind":"added","reason":"New fixed text contains section 订单导出 with the new endpoint and sort requirement; old fixed text has no such section or rule. Raw difference D2 inserts this text at the end. Applicability is not inferred as live without deployment evidence.","summary":"新增订单导出规则：GET /orders/export 按创建时间倒序排列","uncertainties":["No deployment evidence; effective applicability unknown."]}],"protocol_version":"impact-response-v1","reads":{"case_version_ids":[],"difference_ids":[],"ranges":[],"segment_ids":[]},"summary":"Based on fixed old/new source text and raw differences, propose three reviewable rule-change candidates: order retention duration modified from 7 to 9 days, coupon PROMO5 reduction rule deleted, and new order export rule added. Deployment status remains unknown and all candidates require review.","unit":{"id":"parse:51a9af8f-492e-43cf-a793-688fdb61bc32:0:139","kind":"segment"},"unit_outcome":"analyzed","unresolved":[]},"deployment_status":"unknown","issues":[],"manifest_sha256":"e0b10e0eff3e94e4c3abe9213e0c17052fd78a38f2b707c325547d09104d0e53","request_sha256":"49da93b5883c3914fc5b3951b35abad159cf4e816cdc8431adc5c2b59e546b73","response_sha256":"8762b9c672605c0a0fcc70d30b6e7d8b3e7e0b2dd7673cda9576ee2c8884a641","runtime_versions":{"identity_binding":"impact-text-bindings-v1","pydantic":"2.13.5","python":"3.11.16"},"semantic_status":"pending_review","status":"unit_finished","task_id":"23f3a06f